<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c4" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> <span class="c4">Best World Drop Items for Assassination Rogues</span></span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to get powerful gear. This includes World Bosses such as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a> and <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=62346/galleon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Galleon</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c4" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>Sha of Anger is notable in that it drops 496-iLvl Tier 14 legs and gloves, as well as various 483-iLvl Malevolent Gladiator's pieces. This is a great way to get a head start on your tier set if you get lucky. <br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90914/boots-of-raging-haze">
<img alt="Boots of Raging Haze" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_leather_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Raging Haze</span></a>, a decent early pair of boots.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger-2">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c4" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon</span></h3>Galleon is the other world boss available during Phase 1. His loot table consists of multiple 496-iLvl pieces that can be used to compliment many of the other pre-bis options.<br/>
<br/>Galleon drops the following items for Rogues:<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90411/facemask-of-unrepentant-banditry">
<img alt="Facemask of Unrepentant Banditry" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_leather_raidrogue_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Facemask of Unrepentant Banditry</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90432/hellriders-choker">
<img alt="Hellrider's Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_100.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hellrider's Choker</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90420/flameshot-wrap">
<img alt="Flameshot Wrap" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raidrogue_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flameshot Wrap</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90451/cannoneers-gunpowder-carrier">
<img alt="Cannoneer's Gunpowder Carrier" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_leather_raidrogue_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cannoneer's Gunpowder Carrier</span></a></div></li>
