<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> <span class="c4">Best Reputation Items for Assassination Rogues</span></span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. As an Assassination Rogue, we recommend you prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1337/the-klaxxi">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Klaxxi</span></a> or <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1269/golden-lotus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Lotus</span></a>. The Klaxxi offers a Pre-BiS ring as a quest reward once you reach Exalted, as well as a 463 weapon. Golden Lotus offers a Pre-BiS neck reward as part of a quest chain as well as the best chest option prior to raids releasing.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-klaxxi">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
